      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitobiraki pee eyae osanduku lo Sotua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eteshetaka apa Daudi kewan nkajijik te nkanasa e Daudi; neitobir ewueji nepiki osanduku le Nkai, neunoki olng'obor shumata ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 10.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo Daudi, “Meetae hoo oltung'ani obo meteleku Ilawi ake ooidim aatanap osanduku le Nkai, amu etegelua Olaitoriani ninche metanapa osanduku lo Laitoriani, neisiai ninye ntarasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrur Daudi Israel pooki te Yerusalem, pee etum aayau osanduku lo Laitoriani ewueji enye; ine apa neitobiraki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrur Daudi tenebo ilayiok le Aron o Lawi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loo layiok le Kora, o Uriel ilo kitok, tenebo lelo alashera lenyena iip o tikitam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too layiok le Merari, naa Asaia ilo kitok, tenebo ilalashera lenyena iip are o tikitam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Gershom, naa Yoel ilo kitok tenebo ilalashera lenyena iip o tomoni uni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too layiok le Elisafan, naa Shemaia ilo kitok, tenebo ilalashera lenyena iip are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Hebron naa Eliel ilo kitok, tenebo ilalashera lenyena ntomoni isiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Usiel naa Aminadab ilo kitok tenebo ilalashera lenyena iip o tomon oare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Daudi aipotu ilapolosak, Sadok o Abiata o Lawi, o Uriel, o Asaia, o Yoel, o Shemaia, o Eliel, o Aminadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejoki ninche, “Irara intae ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye too Lawi, entisinya naa ate, intae o lalashera linyi, pee itumutumu aayau osanduku lo Laitoriani, Enkai oo Siraeli, ine wueji naitobiraka nanu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki neitu apa intae inapinapa te dukuya, etagorokine iyiook Olaitoriani Enkai ang, enkaraki neitu iyiook kishilaa teina oitoi, nategeluaki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaae neitisiny ate ilapolosak o Lawi, pee etum aayau osanduku lo Laitoriani Enkai e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 25.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nenapu Ilawi ilo sanduku le Nkai too loilila lenye too mbokishi, anaa apa enaitanapishe Musa te risioroto o rorei lo laitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki sii Daudi aitanap lelo kituaak loo Lawi, pee egelu ilalashera lenye pee eranyisho nebuaku te oshoto oo nkinantani, too nkai oo sinkoliotin, o lwululi loo usin o nkinantani, neilepie oltoilo le ng'ida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etegelutua apa Ilawi Heman olayioni le Yoel o lalashera lenyena, Asaf olayioni le Berekia; o layiok le Merari, o lalashera lenye, o Etam olayioni le Kushaia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore tenebo ninche netii ilalashera lenye te ntukus e are e Sakaria o Yaasiel, o shemiramot, o Yehiel, o Uni, o Eliab o Benaia o Maaseia, o Matitia, o Elifele, o Mikneia, o larripok le kishomi, Obed-edom o Yaeil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilaranyak Heman o Asaf o Etan naa pee eosh aaitabuaku nkinantani dapashi o suyai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore Sakaria, o Asiel, o Shemiramot, o Yehiel, o Uni, o Eliab o Maaseia, o Benaia, neosh ninche nkai oo sinkolioitin, te risioroto o ltoilo le Alamot; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake ore Matitia o Elifele, o Mikneia, o Obed-edom o Yerel, o Asasia, nerikoo eoshoto oo lwululi loo usin, terisioroto oltoilo le Shemnit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Kenania olarikoni lo sinkolio too Lawi, ninye orikoo osinkolio, amu keyiolo apa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Berekia o Elkana neaku ilarripok le kutukaji ine netii osanduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Shebania o Yoshefat, o Natanel, o Amasai, o Sakaria, o Benaia, o Eliesa, lelo apolosak, ninche oosh ntarumpetani te dukuya ilo sanduku le Nkai. Ore sii Obed-edom o Yehia naa ninche ilarripok le kutukaji eine netii osanduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ewaki Osanduku lo Sotua Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eshomo apa Daudi o lpayiani, o lkituaak loo nkalifuni, aayau osanduku lo sotua lo Laitoriani te nkaji e Obed-edom te ng'ida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore amu etareto apa Olaitoriani lelo Lawi oonapita osanduku lo sotua lo Laitoriani, etopolosa ninche iloing'ok oopishana, o ilmeregeshi oopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishopito apa Daudi olkila le kitani sidai napiyaya, naa neijia sii eikununo lelo Lawi pooki oonapita osanduku, o laranyak, o Kenania ilo arikoni lo sinkolio o laranyak; neishop Daudi enkila olgoo e Kitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eyautua iltung'ana le Israel pooki osanduku le lning'o lo Laitoriani too mbuakunot, o to ltoilo le mouo, o ntarumpetani, o nkinantani dapashi, nebuaku aaranyisho too nkai oo sinkoliotin, o lwululi loo usin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
